1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,119
Prism Scan runs a Set across your assets, and can keep watching for you.

2
00:00:04,574 --> 00:00:06,303
Open Prism Scan.

3
00:00:06,353 --> 00:00:10,835
Your Sets are on the left, with Angstrom's examples, grouped by trading idea.

4
00:00:13,892 --> 00:00:16,133
Tap plus on Dip in my uptrend.

5
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:18,894
A new scan starts, on your whole watchlist.

6
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:22,939
Press play to run it now, on the latest finished candles.

7
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:34,402
Each asset gets Yes, No, or Unknown, with the reason beside it.

8
00:00:34,874 --> 00:00:37,371
To keep watching, give the scan a schedule.

9
00:00:37,421 --> 00:00:39,535
Here, at every daily close.

10
00:00:39,998 --> 00:00:43,882
And choose where its alerts go: in the app, by email, or both.

11
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:49,386
Your scan now checks every day by itself, and tells you when an answer turns to Yes.
